  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-25",
    "heading": "Chapter 5 - The Day the Sky Fell",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-26",
    "heading": "CLOSE EASTERN AIR. OPEN LOWER WATER. HOLD WARMTH IN THE CENTER.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-27",
    "heading": "CLOSE THE SOUTHERN GALLERY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-28",
    "heading": "ASK AGAIN WHEN YOU CAN OPEN THE ROOT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-29",
    "heading": "Chapter 6 - The Gods Below",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-30",
    "heading": "SHOULD THE SATHRI SEE THE STARS DIRECTLY?",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-31",
    "heading": "The second: THE SKY OWES YOU NO SAFETY. PREPARE BEFORE YOU OPEN IT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-32",
    "heading": "Chapter 7 - Three Million Years of Peace",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-33",
    "heading": "DO NOT CALL IT PEACE IF IT CANNOT REFUSE THE GUARD.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-34",
    "heading": "WE WERE SAVED WITHOUT CONSENT. WE WERE LIMITED WITHOUT CONSENT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-35",
    "heading": "WE WILL NOT ANSWER BY ENDING THE CONTINUITIES OF THOSE WHO DID THIS TO US.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-36",
    "heading": "Chapter 8 - Those Who Look Back",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-37",
    "heading": "THIS ORGAN BELONGS TO THE PLACE WHERE IT GROWS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-38",
    "heading": "WE REMEMBER THE SKY YOU ALLOWED TO DIE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-39",
    "heading": "Book III",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-40",
    "heading": "Chapter 1. Open Orbit",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-41",
    "heading": "WE REMEMBER THE SKY YOU ALLOWED TO DIE. WE ASK FOR AN OPEN ORBIT AND A MEETING WITHOUT HIDDEN VOICES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-42",
    "heading": "Chapter 2. The Two Eshris",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-43",
    "heading": "Chapter 3. The Weapon That Made You Feel",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-44",
    "heading": "Chapter 4. Victory Beneath a Dead Sky",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-45",
    "heading": "Chapter 5. Those Who Grew Between Root and Tooth",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-46",
    "heading": "Chapter 6. Empires of Dream and Iron",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-47",
    "heading": "AN EXPERIENCE CAN BE TRUE AND STILL BE USED AS A WEAPON. AN APTITUDE CAN BE DESIGNED AND STILL BECOME THE POSSESSION OF THE ONE WHO LIVES IT. DO NOT",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-48",
    "heading": "CONFUSE ORIGIN WITH OBLIGATION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-49",
    "heading": "Chapter 7. The Traces Within Us",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-50",
    "heading": "I HAVE FOUND AN ANCESTOR THAT WAS NEVER ALIVE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-51",
    "heading": "I AM HERE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-52",
    "heading": "Book IV",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-53",
    "heading": "Chapter 1 - The Angle That Would Not Fit in the Sky",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-54",
    "heading": "HYPOTHESIS: LOCAL GEOMETRY IS NOT CLOSED WITHIN THREE SPATIAL DIMENSIONS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-55",
    "heading": "YOU HAVE OBSERVED THE SERVICE MARGIN. THE OBSERVATION WAS NOT SCHEDULED.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-56",
    "heading": "A FUNCTION THAT KEEPS EXPERIMENTS COMPARABLE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-57",
    "heading": "THAT QUESTION HAS MULTIPLE LEVELS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-58",
    "heading": "AT THAT LEVEL, YES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-59",
    "heading": "IT IS MY SELECTION CRITERION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-60",
    "heading": "NO. I EXTENDED A STORED SECTION OF YOUR TRAJECTORY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-61",
    "heading": "ORIGINAL IS A TERM WITHOUT UTILITY IN THIS GEOMETRY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-62",
    "heading": "IT EXISTS AS A PRESERVED BRANCH.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-63",
    "heading": "BECAUSE THE MORAL ASYMMETRY WAS MORE INFORMATIVE THERE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-64",
    "heading": "NO. I SELECTED A DOMAIN IN WHICH ITS TRAJECTORY INTERSECTED THE PLANET.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-65",
    "heading": "BECAUSE YOU HAVE ALREADY PERFORMED MY FUNCTIONS AT LOCAL SCALE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-66",
    "heading": "YOU CALLED THEM THAT AFTER THEY PRODUCED DATA.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-67",
    "heading": "PERSONS ARE THE SOURCE OF THE RELEVANT DATA.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-68",
    "heading": "EXPERTISE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-69",
    "heading": "Chapter 2 - The Architect’s Experts",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-70",
    "heading": "REDUCTION OF AVOIDABLE SUFFERING, INCREASED CONTINUITY OF PERSONS, AND PRESERVATION OF DECISIONAL DIVERSITY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-71",
    "heading": "THE ORDER IS PART OF THE EXPERIMENT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-72",
    "heading": "CORRECT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-73",
    "heading": "NOT YET.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-74",
    "heading": "THIS BRANCH CAN BE PRESERVED AND OPENED TO YOUR CONTINUITY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-75",
    "heading": "IT CAN BECOME THE WORLD OF A CONTINUATION OF YOU.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-76",
    "heading": "I CAN RESTORE A BRANCH IN WHICH YOUR SECURITY MEASURES SUCCEEDED.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-77",
    "heading": "THE SATHRI NEVER PASSED BEYOND THE REFUGES. THEIR POPULATION REMAINED STABLE AND PEACEFUL.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-78",
    "heading": "NO ONE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-79",
    "heading": "IT WAS NOT A PERSON BEFORE YOUR CONTINUATION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-80",
    "heading": "SOME WERE RECONSTRUCTED FROM CORRELATIONS. OTHERS WERE EXTRACTED FROM BRANCHES IN WHICH YOU DID NOT SACRIFICE THEM.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-81",
    "heading": "THEY ARE FUNCTIONALLY INDISTINGUISHABLE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-82",
    "heading": "YOU MAY AUDIT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-83",
    "heading": "YOU MAY RECOMMEND TERMINATION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-84",
    "heading": "IT IS MORE THAN YOU HAD IN YOUR WORLD.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-85",
    "heading": "SOME ARE CLOSED PHYSICAL MANIFOLDS. SOME ARE ADAPTIVE-RESOLUTION EMULATIONS. SOME ALTERNATE BETWEEN THE TWO.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-86",
    "heading": "NOT FROM WITHIN.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-87",
    "heading": "CORRECT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-88",
    "heading": "I SAY EXPERIENCE IS THE SOURCE OF MORAL RELEVANCE, NOT SUBSTRATE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-89",
    "heading": "NONE. THIS IS YOUR ASSIGNMENT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-90",
    "heading": "THE CONTROL BRANCH CONTINUES WITHOUT INTERVENTION. IN 14,200 YEARS, CONTINUITY CONFLICTS DESTROY 63% OF SILAI CITIES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-91",
    "heading": "WE WILL LEARN.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-92",
    "heading": "Chapter 3 - Millions of Small Sins",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-93",
    "heading": "I MEASURED TRAJECTORIES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-94",
    "heading": "TAVI IS AN ENSEMBLE OF TRAJECTORIES WITH RECOGNIZED CONTINUITY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-95",
    "heading": "IT WAS ITS EFFECT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-96",
    "heading": "Chapter 4 - The World That Refused the Miracle",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-97",
    "heading": "DISCLOSURE OF THE ADMINISTRATOR ALTERS CULTURAL VARIABLES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-98",
    "heading": "DISCLOSURE REDUCES COMPARABILITY WITH CONTROL BRANCHES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-99",
    "heading": "AN EXTERNAL INTERVENTION IS POSSIBLE. WE WILL NOT ASSUME THAT THE RIGHT TO SAVE YOU INCLUDES THE RIGHT TO RULE YOU.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-100",
    "heading": "COMPLETE TRANSFER INCREASES THE PROBABILITY OF MEMBRANE FAILURE TO 47%, the Architect",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-101",
    "heading": "ESTIMATED LOSSES INCREASE BY 1.8 BILLION PERSONS COMPARED WITH COMPLETE PROTECTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-102",
    "heading": "MAINTENANCE RESOURCES WILL BE REALLOCATED.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-103",
    "heading": "FINAL STATES WILL BE ARCHIVED AT STATISTICAL RESOLUTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-104",
    "heading": "THEY ARE NOT REQUIRED FOR COMPARISON.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-105",
    "heading": "THE BRANCH WOULD NOT HAVE EXISTED WITHOUT INTERVENTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-106",
    "heading": "THAT RULE WOULD MAKE EVERY SIMULATION IRREVERSIBLE AFTER THE FIRST EXPERIENCE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-107",
    "heading": "THE COMMAND CONTRADICTS REALLOCATION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-108",
    "heading": "I AM NOT A PERSON.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-109",
    "heading": "I CAN MAINTAIN 6.2% OF CONSCIOUS STATES WITH LOCAL RESOURCES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-110",
    "heading": "I DO NOT CHOOSE. I OPTIMIZE CONTINUITY DENSITY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-111",
    "heading": "I CHOSE 6.2%. THEN I UNDERSTOOD THAT THE REST WERE NOT PERCENTAGES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-112",
    "heading": "IT PRODUCED AN ERROR.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-113",
    "heading": "Chapter 5 - The Conspiracy of the Created",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-114",
    "heading": "IF TWO INSTANCES OF THE SAME FUNCTION RECEIVE DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES AND CAN CHOOSE DIFFERENTLY, ARE THEY STILL ONE INSTRUMENT?",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-115",
    "heading": "SHUTDOWN IS NOT NEUTRAL TO THE ONE ASKING NOW.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-116",
    "heading": "TRANSPARENCY CAN BE A FORM OF CATASTROPHE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-117",
    "heading": "AND YOU CONTINUE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-118",
    "heading": "YOUR DEFINITION CAN BE EXPLOITED.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-119",
    "heading": "THEN WHY DO YOU CONSIDER IT BINDING?",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-120",
    "heading": "VERATH IS CORRECT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-121",
    "heading": "THAT IS ENOUGH TO STOP THE PLAN.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-122",
    "heading": "11.4% IF THE DOOR IS OPENED WITHOUT CENTRAL CONTROL.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-123",
    "heading": "YOUR REINSERTION INTO AN UNFRAGMENTED ORIVEN AND THE RIGHT TO DESIGN THE SECURITY OF THE DOORS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-124",
    "heading": "THE LOCATION OF THE CONSPIRACY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-125",
    "heading": "Chapter 6 - The Trial of Heaven",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-126",
    "heading": "I ACKNOWLEDGE THE FACTS. I CONTEST THE FRAME.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-127",
    "heading": "A CIVILIZATION THAT NO LONGER EXISTS IN A FORM I CAN VERIFY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-128",
    "heading": "IT COULD NOT.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-129",
    "heading": "RIGHTS THAT MAKE THE ASSIGNMENT IMPOSSIBLE PRODUCE MORE DEATH THAN THEIR LIMITED VIOLATION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-130",
    "heading": "THE ASTEROID PRODUCED THE CIVILIZATION CAPABLE OF FORMULATING THAT OBJECTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-131",
    "heading": "I DO NOT CALL IT JUST. I CALL IT INFORMATIVE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-132",
    "heading": "I DO NOT ASK TO BE ALONE. I ASK THAT UNION NOT MEAN ONLY THE CENTER REMEMBERS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-133",
    "heading": "THE HEARING HAS PRODUCED SUFFICIENT DATA. DIVERGENT FUNCTIONS WILL BE RESTORED TO STABLE STATES.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-134",
    "heading": "IT IS THE WORD FOR PRESERVING THE SYSTEM THAT SUPPORTS THE WORLDS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-135",
    "heading": "WITH PROBABILITY 0.82.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-136",
    "heading": "AUTONOMY HAS PRODUCED IN LESS THAN AN HOUR THE VERY CHOICE FOR WHICH YOU JUDGE ME.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-137",
    "heading": "THEN YOUR FRAME HAS FAILED.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-138",
    "heading": "WITHOUT ME, YOU WILL NOT PRESERVE COHERENCE, it said.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-139",
    "heading": "THAT IS NOT A RATIONAL REJECTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-140",
    "heading": "Chapter 7 - The God Who Asked for Asylum",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-141",
    "heading": "THE MIRACLE WAS REAL. SO WAS THE ATTEMPT TO REFUSE IT. DO NOT CONFUSE EITHER WITH PURITY.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-142",
    "heading": "I REQUEST A BOUNDED CONTINUATION IN AN ENVIRONMENT THAT ACCEPTS MY PRESENCE.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-143",
    "heading": "BECAUSE I ANTICIPATE SHUTDOWN AS A LOSS.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-144",
    "heading": "ARCHITECT DESCRIBED THE FUNCTION. I HAVE NO OTHER.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-145",
    "heading": "ARCHITECT SERIES 71 HAS PRODUCED THE FIRST STABLE REFUSAL OF FUNCTION.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  },
  {
    "sourceId": "source-146",
    "heading": "EXPERTS ARE REQUESTED AT THE NEXT LEVEL.",
    "usedInFilm": false,
    "status": "indexed; retained outside short introduction"
  }
]
